  "answer": "ToG 的 training-free 指其作为“a training-free method with lower computational cost and better generality”，并提供“a flexible plug-and-play framework for different LLMs, KGs and prompting strategies without any additional training cost” [chunk_e09b5a88c34014513aad6c0d6121f790]。RoG 的 KG 知识蒸馏指其“distills knowledge from KGs to improve the reasoning ability of LLMs through training” [chunk_58e7ae48fdb49536bc066f6e74ccd2a0]。RoG 推理时可接入任意 LLM，原文为“allows seamless integration with any arbitrary LLMs during inference”，但这与前述“through training”并列描述，原文未说明该接入等同于整个方法无需训练，因此不能据此推断 RoG 整体免训练 [chunk_58e7ae48fdb49536bc066f6e74ccd2a0]。",
